sary for the skill's news/source/company-search functions.\n[E1] expected: The company-search and finance-enhancement examples transmit lookup identifiers and filters to the same disclosed API; this is purpose-aligned and not evidence of exfiltration by itself.\n[E1] expected: The news_search examples transmit market-news filters to the disclosed API with OPENNEWS_TOKEN authentication; users should understand their token and queries go to the provider.\n[SQP-3] expected: The Chinese/English search guidance supports bilingual keyword formation for news search and does not create a security issue or hidden authority.","agenticRiskFindings":null,"riskSummary":null,"model":null,"checkedAt":1791779571430}}}}}